{"seq":3,"slug":"cl-applications","title":"计算语言学应用","docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"machine-translation","title":"机器翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/machine-translation","wordCount":1682,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-extraction","title":"信息抽取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/information-extraction","wordCount":2003,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"corpus-linguistics","title":"语料库语言学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/corpus-linguistics","wordCount":2225,"readingTime":9},{"seq":4,"slug":"dialogue-speech","title":"对话系统与语音技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/dialogue-speech","wordCount":1758,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"machine-translation","title":"机器翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/machine-translation","wordCount":1839,"readingTime":8},{"seq":6,"slug":"sentiment-analysis","title":"情感分析与观点挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/sentiment-analysis","wordCount":2211,"readingTime":9},{"seq":7,"slug":"dialogue-systems","title":"对话系统与语言生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/dialogue-systems","wordCount":2084,"readingTime":9},{"seq":8,"slug":"sentiment-analysis","title":"情感分析与观点挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/computational-linguistics/cl-applications/sentiment-analysis","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"计算语言学应用-简介\">计算语言学应用 简介</h1><p>本章介绍计算语言学技术在实际场景中的核心应用，从机器翻译到情感分析再到对话系统，展示语言技术如何解决现实问题。</p>\n<p><strong>机器翻译技术</strong>回顾机器翻译从基于规则到统计再到神经网络的技术演进，分析当前神经机器翻译的架构设计和面临的挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>情感分析与观点挖掘</strong>介绍情感分析的任务定义和技术方法，讲解从文档级到方面级情感分析的细粒度进展，以及在舆情监控和产品评价中的应用。</p>\n<p><strong>对话系统与语言生成</strong>讲解任务型对话和开放域对话系统的技术架构，分析自然语言生成的方法以及大语言模型在对话应用中的突破。</p>\n<p>建议读者选择感兴趣的应用领域深入探究，将技术原理与实际应用场景紧密结合。</p>\n"}